@al20878 I've created another test which I'm hoping will confirm the way this mode is intended to work. This is strictly for the VT525.

https://gist.github.com/j4james/cac2cec7fe0df78e59eb52f9c8201599

This script renders a test pattern using the various scrolling and erasing operations which I think are likely to be affected. On the first pass the mode is set, and the second pass it's reset. I'd be grateful if you could take a photograph of the two renditions so I can see how they differ. The test pattern will remain visible until you press <kbd>Enter</kbd> (or whatever the VT525 equivalent).
